From ae8bb270a11c6092ba598c8f23e67e7b73f89f24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Nov 2022 14:32:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix `-acceptnonstdtxn=1` to also work for non-standard
 Scripts (#290)

Specifying `-acceptnonstdtxn=1` currently still rejects spending non-standard Scripts containing e.g. OP_NOP10. This change fixes this.

Rebase provenance: this historical change was adapted onto the pinned
Bitcoin ABC base. Source diff is the recorded Lotus V1 replay commit below.

Historical-source-commit: 01c1cb48643aca528bd23664a6e79cdc979d878e
Recorded-replay-commit: de02141bc8b9093486ec54b2c31b296051a9bb03

